# Public URL of the deployed site.
# Used for canonical URLs, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, canonical/Open Graph tags and
# structured data. Set this to the production domain before deploying.
#
# Do not leave this variable defined but blank. A missing or empty value falls
# back to https://khushi-enterprises.vercel.app (see src/data/site.ts), so the
# production build can never fail on `metadataBase`.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.example.com
